      {
        "rating": 1,
        "title": "Terrible delay",
        "body": "This app was delayed by more than 19 minutes. Watching the news was 10/15 minutes faster than when I would get a notification from the app. Parachutes deployed notification was so delayed , the astronauts were IRL already getting out of the capsule.",
